# 换行符策略（repository-layout.md）：仓库与工作区一律 LF。
# Windows 开发同理：由本文件 + .editorconfig + rustfmt.toml(newline_style="Unix") 三重保证；
# 审计/修复工具：python script/normalize_eol.py [--fix]
* text=auto eol=lf

# 已知二进制类型：禁止规范化，禁止 diff 文本化
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.exe binary
*.pdf binary
*.duckdb binary
*.duckdb.wal binary
